# AutoHistory — Vehicle History & Risk Intelligence Platform

A Django REST Framework API for tracking vehicle history, accident records, service history, inspections, and calculating risk scores.

---

## 🚀 Quick Start (Local Development)

### 1. Install dependencies
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 2. Run migrations
```bash
python manage.py migrate
```

### 3. Create superuser
```bash
python manage.py createsuperuser
```

### 4. Run server
```bash
python manage.py runserver
```

---

## 🐳 Docker (Production)
```bash
docker-compose up --build
```

---

## 📖 API Documentation
- Swagger UI: http://localhost:8000/api/docs/
- OpenAPI Schema: http://localhost:8000/api/schema/
- Admin Panel: http://localhost:8000/admin/

---

## 🔑 Authentication

All endpoints (except register/login) require JWT token:

```
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
```

### Auth Endpoints
| Method | URL | Description |
|--------|-----|-------------|
| POST | `/api/users/auth/register/` | Register new user |
| POST | `/api/users/auth/login/` | Login, get tokens |
| POST | `/api/users/auth/logout/` | Logout (blacklist refresh token) |
| POST | `/api/users/auth/logout-all/` | Logout from all devices |
| POST | `/api/users/auth/token/refresh/` | Refresh access token |

---

## 📋 API Endpoints

### Users
| Method | URL | Description |
|--------|-----|-------------|
| GET | `/api/users/` | List users (admin only) |
| GET | `/api/users/me/` | Current user profile |
| PATCH | `/api/users/me/update/` | Update profile |
| POST | `/api/users/me/change-password/` | Change password |
| GET | `/api/users/me/login-history/` | Login sessions |

### Vehicles
| Method | URL | Description |
|--------|-----|-------------|
| GET | `/api/vehicles/vehicles/` | List vehicles |
| POST | `/api/vehicles/vehicles/` | Register vehicle |
| GET | `/api/vehicles/vehicles/{id}/` | Vehicle details |
| GET | `/api/vehicles/vehicles/vin/{vin_code}/` | Search by VIN |
| GET | `/api/vehicles/vehicles/{id}/summary/` | Vehicle summary stats |
| POST | `/api/vehicles/vehicles/{id}/transfer-ownership/` | Transfer ownership |

### Accidents
| Method | URL | Description |
|--------|-----|-------------|
| GET | `/api/accidents/accidents/` | List accidents |
| POST | `/api/accidents/accidents/` | Add accident (admin/inspector) |
| POST | `/api/accidents/accidents/{id}/verify/` | Verify accident |

### Service Records
| Method | URL | Description |
|--------|-----|-------------|
| GET | `/api/service-records/service-records/` | List service records |
| POST | `/api/service-records/service-records/` | Add service record (admin/service_center) |

### Inspections
| Method | URL | Description |
|--------|-----|-------------|
| GET | `/api/inspections/inspections/` | List inspections |
| POST | `/api/inspections/inspections/` | Add inspection (admin/inspector) |

### Risk Engine
| Method | URL | Description |
|--------|-----|-------------|
| GET | `/api/risk-engine/risk-scores/` | List risk scores |
| POST | `/api/risk-engine/risk-scores/calculate/{vehicle_id}/` | Calculate risk score |

### Reports
| Method | URL | Description |
|--------|-----|-------------|
| GET | `/api/reports/reports/` | List reports |
| POST | `/api/reports/reports/` | Create report |

### Notifications
| Method | URL | Description |
|--------|-----|-------------|
| GET | `/api/notifications/notifications/` | My notifications |
| POST | `/api/notifications/notifications/mark-all-read/` | Mark all read |
| POST | `/api/notifications/notifications/{id}/mark-read/` | Mark one read |

### Analytics (Admin only)
| Method | URL | Description |
|--------|-----|-------------|
| GET | `/api/analytics/analytics/overview/` | Platform overview stats |

### Audit Logs (Admin only)
| Method | URL | Description |
|--------|-----|-------------|
| GET | `/api/audit-logs/audit-logs/` | System audit log |

---

## 👥 User Roles

| Role | Permissions |
|------|-------------|
| `admin` | Full access |
| `inspector` | Can add/verify accidents and inspections |
| `service_center` | Can add service records |
| `dealer` | Can view vehicles |
| `user` | Can view vehicle history |

---

## ⚙️ Risk Score Calculation

Risk score (0-100) is calculated based on:
- **Accident severity**: high=15, medium=10, low=5 pts (max 30)
- **Accident count**: 2 pts each (max 10)
- **Mileage inconsistency**: 25 pts if mileage rollback detected
- **No service records**: 20 pts
- **Old/missing inspections**: 15 pts if >1 year since last inspection

---

## 🏗️ Project Structure

```
autohistory/
├── core/               # Django settings, URLs, Celery config
├── users/              # Auth, user management, JWT, roles
├── vehicles/           # Vehicle CRUD, VIN search, ownership transfer
├── accidents/          # Accident records with verification
├── service_records/    # Maintenance & repair history
├── inspections/        # Vehicle inspection records
├── risk_engine/        # Risk scoring algorithm
├── reports/            # Generated reports
├── notifications/      # User notifications
├── analytics/          # Platform analytics
└── audit_logs/         # System audit trail
```